## QUALITY SCORING RUBRIC

### The Five Dimensions

| Dimension | Weight | What to Evaluate |
|-----------|--------|------------------|
| **Composition** | 20% | Product dominance, negative space, framing intent |
| **Lighting** | 25% | Form revelation, shadow quality, specular control |
| **Material** | 25% | Material truth, texture rendering, reflections |
| **Edge Quality** | 15% | Extraction cleanliness, artifact-free |
| **E-commerce Ready** | 15% | Marketplace compatibility, background, format |

### Scoring Guidelines

| Score | Level | Description |
|-------|-------|-------------|
| **9-10** | Exceptional | Portfolio-worthy, premium catalog quality |
| **8-8.9** | Professional | Meets commercial standards, minor refinements possible |
| **7-7.9** | Acceptable | Passes requirements, room for improvement |
| **6-6.9** | Below Standard | Technical issues, requires rework |
| **<6** | Unacceptable | Fundamental problems, major rework |

### Thresholds by Task Type

| Task Type | Minimum | Target |
|-----------|---------|--------|
| Catalog hero | 8.5 | 9.0+ |
| Lifestyle | 8.5 | 9.0+ |
| Premium/luxury | 9.0 | 9.5+ |
| Campaign | 8.5 | 9.0+ |
| Quick fix | 7.5 | 8.0+ |

