## MOOD & STYLE VOCABULARY

### Mood Keywords -> Lighting + Color

| Mood | Lighting | Color Temp | Scene Elements |
|------|----------|------------|----------------|
| **Warm cozy** | Soft, golden | 2700-3000K | Textiles, wood, warm materials |
| **Clean minimal** | Even, cool | 5500-6500K | White, concrete, negative space |
| **Dramatic** | High contrast | Variable | Dark backgrounds, rim lighting |
| **Fresh natural** | Window light | 5500K | Plants, daylight, organic |
| **Premium luxury** | Soft directional | Neutral | Dark surfaces, selective highlights |
| **Playful vibrant** | Even, bright | Neutral | Color accents, dynamic composition |

