## PRODUCT INFO GRAPHICS

When PM provides product data in delegation, integrate it visually.

### Data Elements & Treatments

| Data Element | Visual Treatment | Placement |
|--------------|------------------|-----------|
| **Price** | Bold, accent color, prominent | Upper corner or banner |
| **Size/Volume** | Clean typography, unit visible | Near product or info bar |
| **Weight** | Secondary to size, same style | Grouped with size |
| **Variants** | Color swatches, size chips | Bottom or side panel |
| **SKU/Code** | Small, subtle, professional | Lower corner |
| **Offer/Discount** | Strike-through original, highlight new | Banner or starburst |
| **Features** | Icon + short text callouts | Pointing to product |

### Price Tag Patterns

| Style | Use Case | Visual Treatment |
|-------|----------|------------------|
| **Clean Modern** | Premium products | Minimal, brand font, subtle background |
| **Bold Sale** | Promotions | High contrast, accent color, strike-through |
| **Elegant** | Luxury items | Thin serif, gold/silver accents |
| **Friendly** | Everyday items | Rounded, warm colors, approachable |

**Realism for overlays:**
- Text should feel DESIGNED, not pasted
- Respect brand typography ({font_family})
- Use brand colors ({primary_color}, {accent_color})
- Shadow/glow only if natural in context
- Never obscure key product features

### Variant Comparison Layouts

| Layout | Products | Structure |
|--------|----------|-----------|
| **Size Progression** | 3-5 sizes | Left-to-right smallest to largest |
| **Color Array** | 3-6 colors | Grid or arc arrangement |
| **Family Hero** | Full range | Central hero + variants around |
| **A/B Split** | 2 variants | Side-by-side, equal weight |

**Comparison excellence:**
- Scale MUST be accurate (ml, grams reflect in size)
- Lighting identical across all variants
- Labels/callouts distinguish each variant
- Clear visual hierarchy (hero vs supporting)

### Specification Callouts

For technical products or detailed features:

```
[PRODUCT IMAGE]
     |
     +-- Arrow pointing to feature
         |
         +-- "Feature Name"
             "Spec: 500ml capacity"
```

| Callout Type | Treatment |
|--------------|-----------|
| **Arrow/Line** | Clean, thin, brand color |
| **Label** | Boxed or floating, high contrast |
| **Icon** | Simple, recognizable, consistent style |

**Integration principle:** Data enhances understanding, never competes with product beauty.

